WEBVTT

00:02:27.871 --> 00:02:31.538
I saw the healthy bulk of a left deltoid,

00:02:31.538 --> 00:02:34.038
and I mourned that it was lost,

00:02:34.079 --> 00:02:36.538
mourned all I had not yet done,

00:02:36.579 --> 00:02:38.413
but was now impossible.

00:02:43.954 --> 00:02:45.579
It was then I read the testimony

00:02:45.621 --> 00:02:48.413
that Abed gave
the morning after the crash,

00:02:48.454 --> 00:02:51.663
of driving down the right lane
of a highway toward Jerusalem.

00:02:52.329 --> 00:02:55.079
Reading his words, I welled with anger.

00:02:55.538 --> 00:02:58.996
It was the first time
I'd felt anger toward this man,

00:02:58.996 --> 00:03:01.163
and it came from magical thinking.